            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Hai Nam Eat Lah District 4",
            "review_text": "AlexSwallow\nSheffield, United Kingdom1718 contributions\n0\nSingapore Chicken rice is one of my favourite dishes in the world\nApr 2026 • Couples\nI was so pleased to find a central place that serves Singapore Chicken rice for a great price.\n\nIt isn't the absolute best I've had (that was in Singapore!) but it is really good. Would just like a bit more choice of condiments.\n\nOther things on the menu are good too, like the Chinese sausage omelette and the roast chicken.\n\nThe staff are welcoming and helpful. \n\nBasically no choice for vegetarians which was a shame- there were things on the menu but the staff member said they couldn't guarantee they hadn't been contaminated by non-vegetarian food.\nRead more\nWritten April 13, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
