            "review_text": "Andy K\n1 contribution\n0\nMost Authentic Singapore Hainanese Chicken Rice Shop In Vietnam!!!\nApr 2024 • Business\nBeen to many Singapore Hainanese Chicken Rice shop in Ho Chi Minh however Eat Lah Vietnam exceeded all my expectations with its unbeatable combination of quality, authenticity, and exceptional service. The chicken rice here is nothing short of perfection, with each component thoughtfully prepared to capture the true essence of this beloved dish. The attentive staff made me feel right at home, providing recommendations and ensuring that every need was met. I was particularly impressed by the unique design atmosphere, which beautifully blends elements of Singaporean culture with Vietnamese charm. A true culinary oasis in the heart of Vietnam!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 22, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
