            "review_text": "Damon W\n1 contribution\n0\nA Taste of Singapore in Ho Chi Minh City\nNov 2023 • Couples\nRecently visited Eat Lah, my favorite Singaporean spot in Ho Chi Minh City, and I’m thrilled to share my experience!\n\nThe recent renovation at Eat Lah caught my eye, the place looks fantastic. As a Singaporean, this is my go-to place, and it never disappoints.\n\nMy friend and I ordered the steamed chicken and onion omelette. The flavors really tasted like home, 10/10. The revamped ambiance adds a delightful touch to the overall experience.\n\nHighly recommended for those craving authentic Singaporean goodness in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 27, 2023",
